 },
 "summary": "A family of glass-passivated surface-mount transient voltage suppressors in the SMB (DO-214AA) package, rated for at least 600 W peak pulse power with a 10/1000 µs pulse. Forty-nine voltage grades run from 5.80 V to 510 V stand-off (6.45 V to 630 V breakdown, 5 % tolerance), each offered unidirectional (A suffix) and bidirectional (CA suffix). Named uses are I/O interfaces, AC/DC power supplies and slow signal lines such as RS232 and RS485. P6SMB6.8CA/TR13 is the bidirectional 6.8 V grade (5.80 V stand-off, 10.5 V clamping at 58.1 A) on a 13-inch reel of 3000.",
 "key_figures": [
